      "message": "Looking for feedback if this seems like a \"proper\" way to have composition\n\nThe issue I\u0027m facing is I can\u0027t have clean `unique_ptr` and `sk_sp` because that requires adding includes to the gpu contexts, which breaks the build isolation.\n\nI also know that a ganesh context is designed to be held by an  `sk_sp` while a skgpu::graphite::context is managed by a `unique_ptr`",
